title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf repo give-back
catalog: CLI command
target: mf repo give-back
summary: Send the selected borrowed copy home, and delete it

!! Reference

```
Send the selected borrowed copy home, and delete it

Its store is checked, then copied back over the remote's (the remote keeps its config.json, configuration and backups), and the mark is lifted. Refused when the remote is no longer marked as lent to this copy. Prints the remote's .metafolder.

Usage: mf repo give-back

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
```
